WEBVTT

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:02.493
Most dealers type every lead in twice,

00:00:02.513 --> 00:00:05.515
with notes scattered across tools.

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:09.778
DealerEdge routes every source through one funnel:

00:00:09.853 --> 00:00:13.505
your site, the marketplaces and Facebook.

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:16.742
It syncs both ways with your CRM,

00:00:16.762 --> 00:00:20.391
so leads, notes and activity flow automatically.

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:25.247
Every call, text and chat is logged on the buyer’s record.

00:00:26.533 --> 00:00:29.894
One record, from the first click to the model they drive home.

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:33.447
No double entry, ever.

00:00:35.867 --> 00:00:37.742
Book a demo with DealerEdge.
